{"title":"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part ii","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2a\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2a</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In any isosceles triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac37c9fa391eebb9601bfaca8bfbfaabdf5ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, the altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> bisects the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f35fe2c75c113f7cdd2f6c59a1ca76e728c540b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = DC$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_ii&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2a\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a\">Problem 2a</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_ii&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_ii&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_i\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part i\">part i</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/6/ca6371efb1262af8539ffffcb75a931ef3fb43cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b2922353df9973ae811b5e4629699112b3a7e389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABC] = \\frac{1}{2} \\times AD \\times BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"195\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d7d35846597924925fcb4735d3ac057b740cdc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABC] = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 24 \\times 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06accfe6b0031a06027dc6c8ca9bb9770bbd8496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=12 \\times 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b056a64b835faa9ed6ab5fe3ba5480c02dfb7b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{168}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224816\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 56/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1115/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nU